# .stim -- per-cycle stimulus for sim_closed_loop.sasm (spec/simulation-spec.md §5.4)
#
# columns: cycle name value
#
# `sp` is bound to an INPUT channel, so each record lands on the plant side
# (raw counts, the physical range of channel 2 is [0,1000]); `cnt#N` is a block
# field, so it lands on the global slot and overrides what the block computed.
# A record holds until the next record for the same name takes over.

1 sp 800
2 cnt#N 77
4 sp 100
